\# Secrets / local overrides
.claude/settings.local.json

\# Generated per-run artifacts (kept out of version control; each run
\# is reproducible from inputs/ + the framework, per rules/architecture.md
\# Audit Everything — the _run-log.md + _decisions.yaml pair reproduces it)
.claude/output/*/step*/
.claude/output/*/_run-log.md
.claude/output/*/_token-telemetry.json
.claude/output/*/_reliability-metrics.json
.claude/shared-context/*/snapshots/

\# Language build artifacts
target/
*.class
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

\# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
